<div class="admin-section">
<h3><i class="fas fa-mobile-alt"></i> Android AdMob (Wrapper)</h3>
<p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem;margin-bottom:10px">Vendos ID-të e AdMob për app Android wrapper. Aplikacioni i lexon automatikisht nga endpoint-i publik.</p>
<div style="background:rgba(255,170,0,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,170,0,.35);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:12px;color:#ffd38a;font-size:.74rem;line-height:1.5">
  <i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i>
  AdMob <strong>nuk shfaqet direkt në website/browser</strong>. Këto ID përdoren vetëm nga aplikacioni Android/iOS wrapper (SDK mobile).
  Për web përdor seksionin <strong>Ad Snippets / AdSense</strong>.
</div>
<form method="POST" action="<%= basePath %>/admin/tools">
  <input type="hidden" name="action" value="save_mobile_admob">
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:10px">
    <label class="form-label"><input type="hidden" name="madm_enabled" value="0"><input type="checkbox" name="madm_enabled" value="1" <%= mobileAdMobSettings.enabled ? 'checked' : '' %>> Enabled</label>
    <label class="form-label">Fullscreen format
      <select name="madm_fullscreen_format" class="form-input">
        <option value="INTERSTITIAL" <%= mobileAdMobSettings.fullscreen_format === 'INTERSTITIAL' ? 'selected' : '' %>>INTERSTITIAL</option>
        <option value="APP_OPEN" <%= mobileAdMobSettings.fullscreen_format === 'APP_OPEN' ? 'selected' : '' %>>APP_OPEN</option>
      </select>
    </label>
    <label class="form-label"><input type="hidden" name="madm_auto_show_app_open_on_start" value="0"><input type="checkbox" name="madm_auto_show_app_open_on_start" value="1" <%= mobileAdMobSettings.auto_show_app_open_on_start ? 'checked' : '' %>> Auto show APP_OPEN on start</label>
    <label class="form-label" style="grid-column:1/-1">AdMob App ID (manifest)<input type="text" name="madm_app_id" class="form-input" value="<%= mobileAdMobSettings.app_id || '' %>" placeholder="ca-app-pub-xxxxxxxx~yyyyyyyy"></label>
    <label class="form-label">Banner Unit ID<input type="text" name="madm_banner_ad_unit_id" class="form-input" value="<%= mobileAdMobSettings.banner_ad_unit_id || '' %>" placeholder="ca-app-pub-xxxxxxxx/zzzzzzzz"></label>
    <label class="form-label">Interstitial Unit ID<input type="text" name="madm_interstitial_ad_unit_id" class="form-input" value="<%= mobileAdMobSettings.interstitial_ad_unit_id || '' %>" placeholder="ca-app-pub-xxxxxxxx/zzzzzzzz"></label>
    <label class="form-label">App Open Unit ID<input type="text" name="madm_app_open_ad_unit_id" class="form-input" value="<%= mobileAdMobSettings.app_open_ad_unit_id || '' %>" placeholder="ca-app-pub-xxxxxxxx/zzzzzzzz"></label>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.72rem">
    Endpoint (JSON): <code><%= basePath %>/api/mobile-ads-config</code><br>
    Compat URL: <code><%= basePath %>/api/mobile-ads-config.json</code><br>
    Për AppCreator24/Appilix vendos URL-n e mësipërme që të lexojë direkt `app_id`, `banner_ad_unit_id`, `interstitial_ad_unit_id`.
  </div>
  <div class="admin-bar" style="justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:10px">
    <button type="submit" class="a-btn a-btn-primary"><i class="fas fa-save"></i> Ruaj Android AdMob</button>
  </div>
</form>
</div>
